<div class="mx-auto max-w-md">
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">📅 添加到我的日历</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">邀请发给 <strong><%= recipientEmail %></strong>。选一个日历，事件会复制一份过去。</p>

    <div class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-3 text-sm space-y-1">
      <div class="font-medium text-slate-900"><%= sourceEvent.summary %></div>
      <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">
        <%- sourceEvent.startsAtLocal %> → <%- sourceEvent.endsAtLocal %>
      </div>
      <% if (sourceEvent.location) { %>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">📍 <%= sourceEvent.location %></div>
      <% } %>
      <% if (sourceEvent.description) { %>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2"><%= sourceEvent.description %></div>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <% if (alreadyAccepted) { %>
      <div class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 p-3 text-sm text-emerald-800">
        ✓ 你已经接受过这个邀请。继续接受会再添加一份。
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <% if (calendars.length === 0) { %>
      <div class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 p-3 text-sm text-amber-900">
        你还没有任何日历。<a href="/app" class="underline">先创建一个</a>，然后回来接受邀请。
      </div>
    <% } else { %>
      <form method="post" action="/event-invite/<%= encodeURIComponent(token) %>/accept" class="mt-5 space-y-3">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>" />
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">加入哪个日历？</label>
          <select name="calendarId" required
                  class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-100">
            <% calendars.forEach(function(c){ %>
              <option value="<%= c.id %>"><%= c.name %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="w-full inline-flex justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-brand-700">添加到此日历</button>
      </form>
    <% } %>

    <p class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
      邀请由 ByWave-Calendar 转发；事件会复制一份到你的日历，发起方修改不会自动同步过来。
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
